"correction so that the remaining comparisons are not over-corrected."
msgstr ""

#: R/nogoldstandard.b.R
msgid ""
"{count} of the {total} latent estimates (class proportion and response "
"probabilities) are at 0% or 100%. Boundary estimates are nonregular: their "
"bootstrap intervals are unreliable and collapse to a single value when every "
"resample stays at the boundary. Tests that agree perfectly fit both "
"perfectly accurate tests and tests that share the same errors, so do not "
"report 0% or 100% sensitivity or specificity from this fit without "
"independent evidence."
msgstr ""

