#: R/decisioncombine.b.R
msgid ""
"About 100 cases is a rough rule of thumb, not a requirement: the number "
"actually needed depends on the expected sensitivity and specificity, the "
"precision wanted and the prevalence (Buderer 1996). This sample supports "
"preliminary estimates, particularly once it is divided across the result "
"patterns."
