"Cut-points maximize the Youden index, J = sensitivity + specificity - 1 "
"(Youden, 1950), over the thresholds midway between adjacent observed values: "
"the empirical estimator of the Youden-optimal cut-point (Fluss et al., "
"2005). A patient is test-positive at or above the cutoff (at or below it "
"when lower values are positive)."
