#: R/enhancedROC.b.R
msgid ""
"Cut-points minimize the squared distance to the top-left corner of the ROC "
"plot, (1 - sensitivity)^2 + (1 - specificity)^2, over the thresholds midway "
"between adjacent observed values (Perkins & Schisterman, 2006); Youden "
"optimization was switched off. A patient is test-positive at or above the "
"cutoff (at or below it when lower values are positive)."
msgstr ""

