"Each row is calculated at the exact displayed threshold; selected thresholds "
"do not need to coincide with the plotting grid."
msgstr ""

#: R/decisioncurve.b.R
msgid ""
"Each row is treated as an independent patient, so the data must have one row "
"per patient; several specimens, blocks or lesions from one patient make the "
"bootstrap intervals and p-values too narrow."
msgstr ""

#: R/enhancedROC.b.R
