#: R/agreement.b.R
msgid ""
"Model-based agreement: the latent ICC and the model-based kappa of Nelson "
"and Edwards (2015), which describe the grading system and a population of "
"pathologists rather than these particular readers. The model-based kappa "
"does not depend on how common each grade is, so it is lower than Fleiss' "
"kappa and must not be quoted as Fleiss' kappa."
msgstr ""

#: R/agreement.b.R
msgid "Model-based kappa"
