#: R/kappaSizeCI.b.R
msgid ""
"The requested confidence interval is too narrow to size in reasonable time: "
"it would need about {n} subjects. The limit that governs the sample size is "
"{dist} away from kappa0, and the required sample size grows roughly as one "
"over the square of that distance. Widen the interval, use more raters, or "
"accept a lower confidence level. As a guide, halving that distance "
"multiplies the required sample size by about four."
msgstr ""

#: R/kappaSizeCI.b.R
msgid ""
"The requested confidence interval is too narrow to size in reasonable time: "
"no sample size can deliver it. The limit that governs the sample size is "
"{dist} away from kappa0, and the required sample size grows roughly as one "
"over the square of that distance. Widen the interval, use more raters, or "
"accept a lower confidence level. As a guide, halving that distance "
"multiplies the required sample size by about four."
msgstr ""

#: R/kappaSizePower.b.R
msgid ""
"The requested power is {power}. A study powered below 50% is more likely to "
