msgid ""
"The required sample size follows the confidence-interval approach of Rotondi "
"and Donner, on the goodness-of-fit models of Donner and Eliasziw (two "
"raters, binary outcome), Altaye, Donner and Klar (binary outcome, more "
"raters) and Altaye, Donner and Eliasziw (three to five categories), as "
"implemented in the kappaSize package."
msgstr ""

