msgstr ""

#: R/kappaSizeCI.b.R
msgid ""
"The required sample size is below 25. For a binary outcome, the "
"goodness-of-fit interval this calculation assumes was found close to its "
"stated coverage from about 25 subjects when the rarer category makes up at "
"least about a fifth of the ratings (Donner and Eliasziw; Altaye, Donner and "
"Klar); for three to five categories no such figure was given, and the "
"expected cell counts are the guide (Rotondi and Donner). Below 25 subjects "
"it has not been shown to hold, so consider enrolling at least 25 subjects."
msgstr ""

#: R/kappaSizePower.b.R
msgid ""
"The required sample size is only {n} {subjects}. The large-sample "
"approximation behind this method does not hold for such small studies, so "
"the figure is only approximate; treat it as a rough guide, not a plan."
msgstr ""

