"%2$d subjects. Inspect the marginal frequency table directly."
msgstr ""

#: R/agreement.b.R
msgid ""
"The test did not detect a difference in marginal distributions (p = %1$.3f). "
"A non-significant result does not establish that the two raters use the "
"categories with equal frequency; it only means no difference was detected in "
"these %2$d cases. Inspect the marginal frequency tables directly to judge "
