msgid ""
"Worked example in use: %1$s. %2$s These are round illustrative numbers "
"chosen to demonstrate the calculation, not pooled estimates from the "
"literature and not values to use for patient care — select Custom values and "
"enter sensitivity, specificity and prevalence from your own population "
